        "final_approval": false,
        "hardware": "Brass corner caps, long front clasp, separate round fitting, side ring and stone feet remain recognizable versus marketing. Rear hinge sections are visible open. Green closed seam is conspicuous but consistent with the design, not demonstrated misclosure.",
        "id": "japan",
        "inspected_paths": [
          "sources/japan/marketing.webp",
          "smoke/japan/desktop-closed.png",
          "smoke/japan/desktop-open.png",
