          "smoke/japan/mobile-open.png"
        ],
        "limitations": [
          "No botanical or photoreal equivalence to marketing.",
          "Moss/foliage detail cannot be resolved fully at default mobile size."
        ],
        "mobile_open": "Closed mobile preserves tree/mound and hardware silhouettes, but fine needles/moss and small fittings lose definition. Desktop/mobile open show hollow wood interior, raised lid and released clasp, fully framed. Exterior tree faces away and is occluded; not evidence it disappeared.",
        "source_context_path": "sources/japan/source_readme.md",
        "terrain": "Cedar retains visible trunk, tiered airy foliage and mossed rocky mound. Runtime foliage is more stippled/planar and moss less plush than the promotional illustration; this agrees with the bounded v2 source limitations.",
        "texture": "Runtime wood is brighter orange and more repetitive than the richer promotional grain; brass and stone are simplified. These are finish/rendering differences, not demonstrated geometry defects.",
